58 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Across the globe, we are watching protests and calls for economic reforms. Financial instability and economic crises have become widespread, and the people are fighting for change. Economic stability is without a doubt essential and stands as a pillar for modern societies. Without this stability, financial pressures, rising living costs, and unemployment leave the public in unrest. The IMF plays a vital role in creating stability and supporting these struggling countries.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
