/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 48 0 R
/T (How has the issue developed throughout the years and how did it all begin?)
/E (How has the issue developed throughout the years and how did it all begin?)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
63 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (The root of this issue can be traced back decades, as markets and economies began to develop further they became more vulnerable to risks. As a result, countries around the world started facing financial and economic instability. One notable event that shaped international financial systems would be the 2008 global financial crisis where disruptions in major markets led to declining economies and unemployment. Over the last few decades, these issues have demonstrated to us how fast countries can collapse and how citizens and families of all ages and backgrounds are impacted. It didn't just affect financial institutions and government budgets; it directly affected incomes, employment, and access to essentials. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
