67 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Inflation is the rate at which the prices of goods and services rise over time. Throughout the years inflation has increased making everyday items and services more expensive. When inflation happens the purchasing power of money decreases making each unit of currency cut back on the amount of goods they purchase compared to the time before that. This has placed many families and businesses under financial pressure.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
