69 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Unemployment in recent years has caused serious suffering and economic hardship, especially for families. As a result of the 2008 financial crisis the IMF estimated that the global financial crisis increased worldwide unemployment by roughly 30 million people, pushing total global unemployment past 205 million in 2009.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
