>>
endobj
71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Economic inequality has sparked public outrage many times. Economic inequality refers to the uneven distribution of incomes and opportunities within a society. The rich keep getting richer and the poor have only gotten poorer. Wealth and opportunities are focused on smaller portions of the population while the majority has to struggle to meet their basic needs. This has a caused a divide and public dissatisfaction.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
