/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (In many cases, especially recently, citizens are unable to provide for themselves and for their families, foods and services have gotten too expensive and people are having to choose between which necessities to keep and which to let go. On social media multiple videos have gained attention, videos showing working individuals talking about choosing between gas, food, and rent.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (These are some of the major socioeconomic factors that have led to outrage and uproar within the public. As financial pressures continue to affect communities the public is coming together and people of all ages, from the youth to the elderly are fighting side by side demanding for a change, demanding for a future without so much struggle, for a future where they are able to provide and live without cutting back on day-to-day necessities. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
