99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (As an international financial institution, the IMF recognizes the importance of maintaining economic stability while addressing social challenges. Its engagement on social spending includes supporting policies that protect vulnerable populations and promote inclusive economic growth.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
100 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
